{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Season is a chaotic couch co-op game! Play alone or with your friends to complete all your orders in time and deliver vegetables, flowers, fish and more to the farmstand!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Play with 1-6 players locally</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059449.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Season can be played alone or with up to 5 of your friends locally. The difficulty of the orders adjusts to the number of players, but the fun remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Play through all four seasons</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059450.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you reach 4 stars you can move on to the next level- the next season! Every season has unique crops, but if you make it to the greenhouse in winter, you will have to plant crops from every season all at once! Are you up for the challenge?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Every crop or animal comes with a unique mechanic</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059448.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every plant requires different treatment. The pumpkin for example is so heavy, it can only be harvested by two farmers (or one very strong farmer, if you are playing alone) .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the little menu book, illustrations explain the crops, that get unlocked one by one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Strawfools wish you the best of luck and most of all a lot of fun this season and every season!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558460?t=1741288822","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/e92830e48fcf81fbbe58cc39af24f58ff0c2e288/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741288822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/69297acfcb4fc3dd74c0a44a6438efcb4ae4b674/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741288822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/69297acfcb4fc3dd74c0a44a6438efcb4ae4b674/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741288822","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Season is a chaotic couch co-op game! Play alone or with your friends to complete all your orders in time and deliver vegetables, flowers, fish and more to the farmstand!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Play with 1-6 players locally</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059449.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Season can be played alone or with up to 5 of your friends locally. The difficulty of the orders adjusts to the number of players, but the fun remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Play through all four seasons</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059450.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you reach 4 stars you can move on to the next level- the next season! Every season has unique crops, but if you make it to the greenhouse in winter, you will have to plant crops from every season all at once! Are you up for the challenge?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Every crop or animal comes with a unique mechanic</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/extras/1000059448.gif?t=1741288822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every plant requires different treatment. The pumpkin for example is so heavy, it can only be harvested by two farmers (or one very strong farmer, if you are playing alone) .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the little menu book, illustrations explain the crops, that get unlocked one by one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Strawfools wish you the best of luck and most of all a lot of fun this season and every season!\u00a0</p>","developers":["Jorin Salewski","Annabelle R\u00e4th","Patrick Degen","Alessia Brinkmann","Aleksei Lolovski"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558460/cbf7c215b51c33a49f1bdcc36469679c74456b72/header.jpg?t=1741288822","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107969,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107969/movie480.mp4?t=1741288820","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107969/movie_max.mp4?t=1741288820"},"name":"In_SeasonTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s